    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Kingdom</strong><br>Idle Kingdom is an idle game inspired by old-school RPGs. It offers a wide variety of skills to enhance your character's growth and strength. From combat to gathering, Idle Kingdom has a bit of everything you could want. Train endlessly, defeat enemies, and collect their rare loot for yourself. You can also craft your own equipment and train various non-combat skills. Idle Kingdom is perfect for scratching that &quot;number-go-up&quot; itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong><br>Players can train a variety of skills, whether they choose to become a warrior, archer, or mage! If combat isn\u2019t your style, you can focus on classic skills such as mining, woodcutting, fishing, cooking, smithing, artisanry, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong><br>Visit the market to purchase upgrades that make your adventure easier and more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong><br>Idle Kingdom features multiple areas filled with enemies to defeat. Explore them all to test your strength and claim rewards!<br><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also offer a number of minigames for players to enjoy. These fun challenges provide a great way to earn extra rewards.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Kingdom</strong><br>Idle Kingdom is an idle game inspired by old-school RPGs. It offers a wide variety of skills to enhance your character's growth and strength. From combat to gathering, Idle Kingdom has a bit of everything you could want. Train endlessly, defeat enemies, and collect their rare loot for yourself. You can also craft your own equipment and train various non-combat skills. Idle Kingdom is perfect for scratching that &quot;number-go-up&quot; itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong><br>Players can train a variety of skills, whether they choose to become a warrior, archer, or mage! If combat isn\u2019t your style, you can focus on classic skills such as mining, woodcutting, fishing, cooking, smithing, artisanry, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong><br>Visit the market to purchase upgrades that make your adventure easier and more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong><br>Idle Kingdom features multiple areas filled with enemies to defeat. Explore them all to test your strength and claim rewards!<br><strong>Minigames</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We also offer a number of minigames for players to enjoy. These fun challenges provide a great way to earn extra rewards.</p>",
    "short_description": "Idle Kingdom is all about &quot;number-go-up&quot;. Over 10 skills to train, lots of enemies to defeat, and so many items to collect!",
